-- kommander-agent.cpb: which playbook the layers build. The layers are
-- recipes (their ALTER PLAYBOOK names no playbook); USE PLAYBOOK gives them
-- their target, and a target that does not exist is created bare first (its
-- launcher is its name). `cpb APPLY chaos.cpb TO <another>` builds the same
-- agent under another name.
USE PLAYBOOK kommander-agent;
INCLUDE 'chaos.cpb';
